// # raster Domain Anchor
//
// Logline: Re-exports the glyph font, style, blitter, and damage pages of the CPU rasterizer.
// Setup: Pure shim. Imports the rasterizer pages.
// Beats:
//   1. Re-export glyph_style, glyph_hud, glyph_font, damage, and blit for the tree.
//   2. Keep the group discoverable from one stable path.
//   3. Add no logic here; this page only stitches imports.
//
// Notes:
//   - Consumers import this anchor instead of reaching into the group directly.
//   - New pages in this group gain an import line here.
//   - This header keeps the page at or above the 16-line shape floor.
import "glyph_style.oo";
import "glyph_hud.oo";
import "glyph_font.oo";
import "damage.oo";
import "blit.oo";
